^XA
^FX Backfeed before printing: the next label waits in the cutter, not on the platen^FS
~JSB
^FX Print mode: cutter. Printers without a cutter: use MMT (tear-off) and remove the JSB line^FS
^MMC
^FX Media tracking: gap/die-cut labels. Black-mark stock: use MNM instead^FS
^MNW
^FX Media type: direct thermal (no ribbon)^FS
^MTD
^FX Print speed and feed speed, inches per second^FS
^PR6,6
^FX Darkness, 0-30. Adjust for your label stock^FS
~SD10
^FX Save everything to the printer's memory. Without this, settings revert at the next power cycle^FS
^JUS
^FX Printable line: confirms the label printed, and lets the Nextgen preview enable Print^FS
^FO30,30^A0N,40,40^FDPrinter configured^FS
^XZ
